    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE TOBACCO TAX ACT, NO. 08 OF 1999",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      229.37,
      401.91,
      253.55
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      267.41,
      401.88,
      290.75
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Tobacco Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      303.41,
      401.89,
      338.75
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 15 of the Principal Act is hereby amended byrepealing sub-section 15 (1) of the said Act and by thesubstitution of the following paragraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      351.41,
      401.93,
      446.75
    ],
    "text": "\u201c15. (1) Every person is guilty of an offence underthis Act shall on conviction after summary trialbefore a Magistrate be liable to a fine of threetimes of the value of the goods forfeited by theDepartment of Customs or the ExciseDepartment under this Act or imprisonment ofeither description for a term not exceeding fiveyears.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      459.41,
      401.9,
      482.75
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
